# The built embed. Source is src/embed/; `pnpm build` produces this, and both
# `wrangler dev` and `wrangler deploy` run that build first (wrangler.jsonc). A
# committed bundle would drift from its source with nothing failing (#5).
public/embed.js
public/embed.js.map
.dev.vars
.env
.env.*
!.env.example
*.log
.DS_Store
coverage/
.turbo/

# Local machine config: hooks and permissions belong to a developer, not to a repo
# whose root Cloudflare treats as a deploy root.
.claude/settings.local.json
# Agent worktrees are whole nested checkouts of this repo (#54).
.claude/worktrees/

# Scratch written by the superpowers skills. Design lives in the GitHub issue, so
# plan files must never be committed here.
.superpowers/

# Local product record for design sessions (impeccable). Contains positioning,
# which CLAUDE.md forbids in this public repo.
PRODUCT.md
.impeccable/

# Product context for the impeccable skill. Strategy and positioning —
# CLAUDE.md forbids publishing it, and this repo is public.
PRODUCT.md
